+// License. See LICENSE.TXT for details.
+//
+//===----------------------------------------------------------------------===//
+//
+// This file defines MachineCodeInfo, a class used by the JIT ExecutionEngine
+// to report information about the generated machine code.
+//
+// See JIT::runJITOnFunction for usage.
